{"productId": "fd520870-c020-4097-8ef1-89294b8baa3e", "modelName": "T1x UPR", "modelDescription": "Tikka takes the popular T1x platform to the next level with the T1x UPR. One of the most notable upgrades is its stock, which features a full fiberglass construction with carbon fiber bedding on the surface. This increases the rigidity of the stock, which in turn increases the accuracy. This precision-style stock also utilizes a vertical grip for greater ergonomics when shooting from a prone position. Cheek height and length of pull can be adjusted to fit virtually any shooter, and a rough texturing ensures a superior grip even in adverse conditions. In addition, the T1x features a cold hammer forged barrel with a cross-over profile that provides the stability of a heavy barrel but doesn\u2019t add noticeable weight. The weather-resistant stainless steel bolt offers a smooth action and the utmost reliability.", "manufacturerName": "Tikka", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "45119359-d321-43e9-8376-4cfcb2b3a79e", "description": "Tikka, T1x UPR, Bolt Action, 22 Long Rifle, 20 Threaded Barrel, Black Finish, Desert Sand Synthetic Stock, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/574a214a-de57-4815-943a-3667cd781210", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a0fe50b1-efb3-4efc-a369-eb8fd7538bd2", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/ae8b8e14-9a27-4cef-81fb-67c977009b0c"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "JRT1XU300", "upc": "082442943534", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d-8fb7-5b572b01f4ee", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "e71095dd-53c5-4a65-b75c-b1ec53875881", "valueName": "10 Round"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "bc23294e-268d-44d0-9d70-3969474a274f", "valueName": "20\""}, {"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5b